/E (Tee is UCS dedicated and experienced QHSE Manager, committed to upholding the highest standards across the company. With close to 15 years of service, Tee brings deep institutional knowledge and a steady hand to every project. Tee leads the charge in fostering a culture of safety, continuous improvement, and accountability, working closely with all departments to ensure everyone goes home safe, every day. His efforts are key to maintaining compliance, reducing risk, and empowering teams with the tools and training they need to succeed.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [32]
>>
